<h1 style="font-size:clamp(36px,5.5vw,64px)">Where Every Team <span class="acc">Moved.</span></h1>
<p class="lead">FanDuel Sports Network shut down after the 2025-26 season. These 13 teams had to find new local homes: the Hawks, Hornets, Cavaliers, Pistons, Pacers, Clippers, Grizzlies, Heat, Bucks, Timberwolves, Thunder, Magic and Spurs.</p>
<p class="sub">Most signed one-year deals, because the NBA is working on a central local-TV package for 2027-28. Expect another shake-up next fall. Checked {{ site.localChecked }}.</p>
