<div class="dc"><span class="n">DAZN · 8 TEAMS</span><h3>Streaming</h3><p>Hornets, Cavaliers, Pistons, Pacers, Grizzlies, Timberwolves, Magic and Spurs stream local games on DAZN.</p></div>
<div class="dc"><span class="n">ANTENNA · 6 TEAMS</span><h3>Free TV first</h3><p>Hawks, Pistons, Hornets, Heat, Bucks and Magic made free broadcast TV their main local home.</p></div>
<div class="dc"><span class="n">THEIR OWN WAY</span><h3>Thunder and Clippers</h3><p>The Thunder built the Thunder Gameday Network and Thunder+. The Clippers brought back ClipperVision, with select games on KTLA.</p></div>
